[l_english.INVENTORY_ITEM_4EP_C04_WASHOUTS_PROFILE]
The Washouts Profile

[l_english.INVENTORY_ITEM_4EP_C04_WASHOUTS_PROFILE_DESC]
Lightning Dust, Rolling Thunder, and Short Fuse, the leaders of the notorious Washouts, have come to Stratusburg with the support of the Empire. It is clear that they are up to no good. Therefore, we have conducted a thorough investigation of them, hoping to find something.

